.ϝ��"$お疲れ様でしたそいさん！**Korean Hangul & Pronunciation Rules by Soi2 Korean Hangul Pronunciation 8��@���J�<p>Teaches hangul and rules for pronunciation and pronunciation changes. Contains IPA transcription and romanisation. Further information is provided in the cards as excerpts from the below resources.</p>
